(4, 3, 'text', '<p data-path-to-node=\"1\">Jab hum kisi se baat karte hain ya Google par kuch search karte hain, to hamare words ke peeche ek khaas wajah hoti hai—wahi hamara <b data-path-to-node=\"1\" data-index-in-node=\"132\">Intent</b> hota hai.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"2\">Digital duniya aur AI (jaise ki main) ke sandarbh mein iske 3 bade matlab hote hain:</p><h3 data-path-to-node=\"3\">1. User Intent (Aapka Maqsad)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"4\">Jab aapne mujhse \"PHP code\" maanga, to aapka <b data-path-to-node=\"4\" data-index-in-node=\"45\">Intent</b> sirf code dekhna nahi tha, balki apne Hostinger server ki files ko manage karna tha. AI ka kaam aapke words se zyada aapke \"Intent\" ko samajhna hota hai taaki wo wahi cheez de jo aapko asal mein chahiye.</p><h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">2. Search Intent (Google Par)</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"6\">Google par jab log kuch type karte hain, to unka intent alag-alag ho sakta hai:</p><ul data-path-to-node=\"7\"><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Informational:</b> Kuch jaan na (e.g., \"PHP kya hai?\")</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Navigational:</b> Kisi website par jaana (e.g., \"Hostinger login\")</p></li><li><p data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"7,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Transactional:</b> Kuch kharidna (e.g., \"Buy Domain\")</p></li></ul><h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">3. Programming Mein Intent</h3><p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Android ya App development mein <code data-path-to-node=\"9\" data-index-in-node=\"32\">Intent</code> ek message ki tarah hota hai jo ek \"action\" ko perform karne ke liye use hota hai. Jaise: ek screen se doosri screen par jaana ya camera open karna.<br><br><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQwOp5iEV8PpFQKIkjYQ-Cibh-JLv6WHQitCw&amp;s\" alt=\"Image\"></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTs16jXNqfunIjSJDBoam-P7yNA-Z8WJgXaLQ&amp;s\" alt=\"Image\"></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; margin: 20px 0;\">\n                        <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RBSUwFGa6Fk\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 12px;\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\">\n                        </iframe></div><p data-path-to-node=\"9\"><br></p>', 1, '2026-01-13 04:52:01', '2026-01-13 04:52:01'),
(5, 4, 'text', 'tesrting strat hai boss', 1, '2026-01-13 05:00:41', '2026-01-13 05:00:41'),
(6, 5, 'text', 'ye rha topic boss', 1, '2026-01-13 05:01:17', '2026-01-13 05:01:17'),
