(9, 11, 'text', '<p>Welcome to <strong>InternshipADDA</strong>, an online platform for Internships and Projects.</p>\r\n<p>At InternshipADDA, we help you <strong>explore, understand, and learn</strong> the topics you have selected. After a few lectures, you will be given <strong>assignments and tasks</strong> that will help you understand how these concepts are applied in real industry scenarios.</p>\r\n<p>Once you complete the lectures, you will be guided to solve <strong>practical problems</strong> to sharpen your skills. By the end of the program, you should be able to apply the skills you have learned to solve <strong>industry-level problems</strong> relevant to your domain.</p>\r\n<p>We strongly recommend that you <strong>mention your enrollment or successful completion</strong> of the InternshipADDA program on your social media profiles such as <strong>LinkedIn, Instagram, Facebook</strong>, etc.<br>\r\nNowadays, showcasing your achievements is very important, as employers often check your <strong>LinkedIn profile and online presence</strong> during the hiring process.</p>\r\n<p>Please follow us on our social media platforms:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>LinkedIn</li>\r\n<li>Instagram</li>\r\n<li>Facebook</li>\r\n<li>YouTube</li>\r\n<li>Twitter</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>You will also receive <strong>complete interview preparation material</strong>, including questions on <strong>Reasoning, Mathematics, English</strong>, and more. This material will help you during <strong>campus drives and company interviews</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>InternshipADDA also offers a <strong>Student Referral Program (SRP)</strong>, where you can recommend our training courses to your friends and classmates. You can <strong>earn money on every successful referral</strong> while helping your friends save money. More details about SRP are available on your <strong>Dashboard (last menu)</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>The key to success is <strong>regularity and punctuality</strong>. Please attend the lectures regularly and stay consistent throughout the program.</p>\r\n<p>If you have any questions, feel free to write to us at<br>\r\n📧 <strong>career.internshipadda@gmail.com</strong></p>\r\n<p>At the end of the internship program, there will be an <strong>assessment</strong> based on your learning experience with InternshipADDA. After submitting the assessment, you can <strong>download your certificate</strong> directly from your <strong>Dashboard</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>Happy Learning!<br>\r\n<strong>Team InternshipADDA<br><br><br>local image uplaod<br></strong><img src=\"/public/uploads/images/media_6975902d902b00.83358999_1769312301.png\" alt=\"3d - Copy.png\"></p><p><br></p><p>online image uplaod<br><br><img src=\"https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTu6avszPjAP6xnAOQ_I0F43OsDFi4AqqBYGA&amp;s\" alt=\"Image\"></p><p><br></p><p></p><div contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0px; overflow: hidden; max-width: 100%; margin: 20px 0px; border-radius: 12px;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dCsmV94rzxU\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0px; left: 0px; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 12px; border: none;\"></iframe></div><br><br><p></p><p>local video upload<br><br></p><div contenteditable=\"false\" style=\"margin: 20px auto; max-width: 100%; background: rgb(249, 250, 251); border: 2px solid rgb(229, 231, 235); border-radius: 12px; padding: 8px;\"><video controls=\"\" preload=\"metadata\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; border-radius: 8px; display: block; background: rgb(0, 0, 0);\"><source src=\"https://lms.devsarun.io/public/uploads/videos/media_69759b35d803b_1769315125.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>', 1, '2026-01-15 16:44:04', '2026-01-25 04:25:37'),
