(46, 20, 'What is the purpose of the \'alt\' attribute in an &lt;img&gt; tag?', 'multiple_choice', 'To specify the image\'s URL,To provide alternative text for screen readers and when the image cannot be displayed,To set the image\'s size,To link the image to another page', 'To provide alternative text for screen readers and when the image cannot be displayed', 1, 2),
